---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Compliance Documents | Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van®" description="Authorised event compliance documents for Vincenzo's Fish & Chips Van.">
<section class="docs-hero"><div class="container"><div class="kicker">Authorised access</div><h1 class="page-title">Event Compliance Documents</h1><p class="lead">Current compliance documents for event organisers, venues and relevant authorities.</p></div></section>
<section class="section docs-section"><div class="container"><div class="docs-head"><div><div class="kicker">Document library</div><h2>Everything in one place.</h2></div><p>Documents will appear here as they are uploaded and verified. Each item will include its current status and a direct download link.</p></div><div class="docs-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Public Liability Insurance</h3><p>Current insurance certificate and policy evidence.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Street Trader Licence</h3><p>Current trading licence documentation.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Food Business Registration</h3><p>Registration and food business compliance documents.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Gas Safety</h3><p>Current gas safety certification.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>05</span><h3>Electrical / PAT</h3><p>Electrical safety and PAT testing records.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>06</span><h3>Food Hygiene Training</h3><p>Relevant staff food hygiene certificates.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>07</span><h3>Risk Assessments</h3><p>Event and operational risk assessment documents.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>08</span><h3>Fire Safety</h3><p>Fire safety records and related certificates.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article><article><span>09</span><h3>Allergen & Food Safety</h3><p>Allergen information and food safety documentation.</p><b>Awaiting upload</b></article></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.docs-hero{padding:175px 0 80px;background:#111;color:#fff}.docs-section{background:#f7f2e9}.docs-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:40px;align-items:end}.docs-head h2{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.6rem);font-weight:400}.docs-head>p{color:#666;line-height:1.7}.docs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:42px}.docs-grid article{padding:28px;border:1px solid #ded5c8;border-radius:18px;background:#fff}.docs-grid article>span{display:inline-flex;width:36px;height:36px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;background:#111;color:#fff;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:900}.docs-grid h3{margin:18px 0 8px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.45rem}.docs-grid p{color:#666;line-height:1.55}.docs-grid b{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;color:#a80d13;font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}@media(max-width:850px){.docs-head,.docs-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}} </style>
